title: ERC minority government with CUP support

You should not be here??! Report a bug if you see this 🙏🙏

please please do so via <a class="link" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/broken-arrows/route_to_itaca/issues">GitHub Issues</a>

you're allowed to make a wish once you do so! ✨

- @post_event.make_a_wish

@erc_minority
title: ERC <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="erc" data-summary="Minority government - [+ erc_parlament_s +] / [+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;">minority Government</span></span> with CUP support
view-if: parlament_coalition_option_erc_min_cup_visible
choose-if: parlament_erc_cup_support_available
unavailable-subtitle: ERC must lead a viable minority cabinet and the CUP must be willing to support it from outside government.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_indy = 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage = Math.max(20, Q.cup_parlament_s * 55 / Math.max(1, Q.parlament_coalition_erc_cup_s));
    Q.cup_support_coalition_kind = "erc_minority";
    Q.cup_support_coalition_phase = 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leader = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_follower = "cup";
    Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats = Q.erc_parlament_s;
    Q.parlament_coalition_support_seats = Q.parlament_coalition_erc_cup_s;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = "erc";
    Q.speaker_party = "cup";
    Q.speaker = Q.year < 2017 ? "Julià de Jòdar" : "Vidal Aragonés";
    Q.speaker_gender = "m";
    Q.month_actions += 1;
!}
call: parlament_coalition_fiscal_policies.initialize

ERC has offered CUP the Speaker of the House in return for supporting an ERC minority cabinet. [? if player_party = "cup": We can accept the office or leave it to ERC and preserve more leverage for the investiture agreement.?][? if player_party = "erc": We can confirm CUP's nominee or retain the office at the cost of a harder investiture negotiation.?]

- @cup_speaker
- @erc_speaker

@cup_speaker
title: Elect [+ speaker +] as Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 10;
!}
go-to: demands

@erc_speaker
title: Retain the Speaker of the House for ERC
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "erc";
    Q.speaker = Q.year < 2016 ? "Anna Simó" : "Roger Torrent";
    Q.speaker_gender = Q.year < 2016 ? "f" : "m";
!}
go-to: demands

@demands
new-page: true
go-to: parlament_coalition_fiscal_policies.summary
set-jump: demands_menu

@demands_menu

The CUP will remain outside the cabinet. The remaining question is what ERC must promise in exchange for the CUP's affirmative investiture vote.

[? if parlament_coalition_policy_reject_reasons: [+ parlament_coalition_policy_reject_reasons +] ?]

[? if parlament_coalition_concessions_indy: **National programme:** Follow CUP's stronger independence roadmap.?]

- @policy_concessions
- @form

@indy
title: Include CUP's independence roadmap
choose-if: not parlament_coalition_concessions_indy and cup_roadmap > erc_roadmap and parlament_coalition_leverage >= 5
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_coalition_concessions_indy: This commitment is already part of the agreement.?][? if cup_roadmap <= erc_roadmap: ERC's roadmap is already at least as ambitious.?][? if parlament_coalition_leverage < 5: We don't have enough leverage to demand this. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_policy_indy_demanded = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 5;
    Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_indy = 1;
!}
go-to: policy_concessions

@form
title: Conclude the investiture agreement
choose-if: parlament_coalition_leverage >= 0 and ((speaker_party = "cup" and ((parlament_coalition_policy_education or parlament_coalition_policy_health or parlament_coalition_policy_pay or parlament_coalition_policy_tax) or parlament_coalition_concessions_indy)) or (speaker_party = "erc" and (parlament_coalition_policy_education or parlament_coalition_policy_health or parlament_coalition_policy_pay or parlament_coalition_policy_tax) and (parlament_coalition_concessions_indy or cup_roadmap <= erc_roadmap)))
unavailable-subtitle: [? if speaker_party = "cup": With the Speaker of the House, the CUP expects further commitments and a stronger presence in government.?][? if speaker_party = "erc": Without the Speaker of the House, the CUP expects further commitments and a stronger presence in government.?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_accept = true;
!}
call: parlament_coalition_fiscal_policies.evaluate
go-to: formed if parlament_coalition_proposal_accept; demands if not parlament_coalition_proposal_accept

@formed
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_policy_accepted = true;
    Q.parlament_coalition_policy_scope = "external_support";
    Q.cup_support_coalition_phase = 0;
    Q.cat_coalition = ["erc"];
    Q.cat_coalition_support = ["cup"];
    Q.cat_coalition_abstain = [];
    G.setText(Q, "cat_coalition_disp", G.governmentTooltipText("generalitat", Q.cat_coalition, G.text("Minority government - {seats}/{majority}", {
        seats: String(Q.erc_parlament_s),
        majority: String(Q.parlament_s_majority)
    }), G.text("<span style='color: var(--erc); font-style: italic;'>ERC minority Government</span>")));
    Q.cat_coalition_dissent = 0;
    Q.erc_in_gob = true;
    Q.erc_supporting = true;
    Q.cup_in_gob = false;
    Q.cup_supporting = true;
    G.setText(Q, "position_disp", (Q.player_party == "erc" ? G.text("Generalitat") : G.text("<span style='font-style: italic'>External support</span>")));
    Q.independence_trust += Q.parlament_coalition_concessions_indy ? 5 : 1;
!}

ERC will form a [+ cat_coalition_disp +]. The CUP has secured written commitments but will hold no ministries.

- @parlament_coalition_resolve: A new government is formed!
@policy_concessions
title: Propose Policy Commitments
call: parlament_coalition_fiscal_policies
set-jump: policy_concessions

[? if parlament_coalition_policy_surplus < 0: The current Generalitat deficit makes spending commitments harder to secure, though.?]

- @indy
- #fiscal_concessions
- @demands: Finish proposing policies
